# Microsoft Sentinel — Environment Setup

## Objective

Deploy the Azure resources required for Microsoft Sentinel.

## Deployment

### 1. Create Resource Group

```bash
az group create \
  --name rg-sentinel-lab \
  --location eastus
```

### 2. Create Log Analytics Workspace

```bash
az monitor log-analytics workspace create \
  --resource-group rg-sentinel-lab \
  --workspace-name law-sentinel-lab \
  --location eastus
```

### 3. Enable Microsoft Sentinel

Azure Portal:

```text
Microsoft Sentinel
→ Create
→ Select: law-sentinel-lab
→ Add
```

### 4. Verify

```bash
az monitor log-analytics workspace show \
  --resource-group rg-sentinel-lab \
  --workspace-name law-sentinel-lab
```

